Change defaults of new profiles (from the audit prefs track,
audit/prefs-decisions.toml).

- Send Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control (Sec-GPC: 1, with its setting
  shown in privacy settings).
- Don't verify e-mail addresses with their provider before consent
  (Email Verification Protocol).
- Hide the Chrome Web Store icon and tile (the store backend does not work).
- Continue where you left off: restore the previous session at startup, without
  the infobar announcing it.
- One profile only: no guest mode, no "add profile", and the profile button
  hidden (ungoogled --show-avatar-button / chrome://flags still override it).
